-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/mesoamerican-codices"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/mesoamerican-codices.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Mesoamerican codices</span><span class="enc-type">Work / monument</span><span class="enc-snip">Mesoamerican codices are folding books painted on bark paper or deerskin by the peoples of Mesoamerica, recording history, religion, calendars and tribute.</span></a></li></ul>
